  "instructions": [
    "In a large bowl, whisk together olive oil, garlic, red pepper flakes, salt, and pepper.",
    "Add the chicken, onion, and parsley to the bowl. Toss to coat.",
    "Thread the chicken and vegetables onto the skewers, leaving a small space between each piece.",
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
